DATA NOTE: This repository contains DERIVED, aggregate outputs from the
Bangladesh Demographic and Health Survey (BDHS). Raw BDHS microdata are NOT
included. Access to raw BDHS microdata requires registration with the DHS
Program (https://dhsprogram.com) and approval of a specific project request.
The CC-BY-4.0 license above covers the code, derived outputs, and writing in
this repository — not the underlying BDHS microdata, which remains subject to
the DHS Program's own data-use terms.
